  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "rd01",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 29.36,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd01-01",
          "zh": "想象一个孩子。",
          "en": "Imagine a child.",
          "start": 4.769,
          "slot": 1.223,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 1.223,
            "en": 2.179
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-01.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 1.223
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-02",
          "zh": "别人把故事念给他听，他能说出发生了什么。",
          "en": "When someone reads a story aloud, he can tell us what happened.",
          "start": 6.608,
          "slot": 3.837,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.837,
            "en": 3.697
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-02.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.837
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-03",
          "zh": "轮到自己读，有些字却让他停下来。",
          "en": "When he reads it himself, some words stop him.",
          "start": 10.906,
          "slot": 3.861,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.861,
            "en": 3.618
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-03.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.861
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-04",
          "zh": "我们在学习阅读障碍的资料时，注意到这样的情况。",
          "en": "We noticed examples like this while learning about dyslexia.",
          "start": 15.306,
          "slot": 4.911,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.911,
            "en": 4.374
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-04.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.911
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-05",
          "zh": "有些孩子，认字、拼写很困难。",
          "en": "Some children find word reading and spelling difficult.",
          "start": 20.563,
          "slot": 2.629,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 2.629,
            "en": 3.478
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-05.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.629
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-06",
          "zh": "但单看这一点，还不能知道这个孩子能理解什么、能做什么。",
          "en": "That alone does not tell us everything they can understand or do.",
          "start": 23.769,
          "slot": 4.899,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.899,
            "en": 5.335
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-06",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd01-06.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.899
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd02",
      "start": 29.36,
      "end": 47.929,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd02-01",
          "zh": "所以，我们可以看看：这个孩子需要什么帮助？",
          "en": "So we can ask: what help does this child need?",
          "start": 29.898,
          "slot": 4.003,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.003,
            "en": 3.434
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd02-01.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.003
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-02",
          "zh": "如果今天是理解故事，可以听、看图，再聊一聊。",
          "en": "If today's goal is to understand a story, we can listen, look at pictures, and talk about it.",
          "start": 34.248,
          "slot": 4.229,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.229,
            "en": 6.479
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd02-02.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.229
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-03",
          "zh": "需要练认字时，就认真练认字，也给合适的帮助。",
          "en": "When the goal is word reading, we practise reading with suitable support.",
          "start": 38.823,
          "slot": 4.161,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.161,
            "en": 5.452
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd02-03.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.161
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-04",
          "zh": "每个孩子的情况不一样，我们要先了解他。",
          "en": "Each child is different. We need to get to know the child in front of us.",
          "start": 43.484,
          "slot": 3.753,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.753,
            "en": 4.698
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd02-04.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.753
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd03",
      "start": 47.929,
      "end": 72.975,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd03-01",
          "zh": "这启发我们想到中英文学习。",
          "en": "This led us to think about learning Chinese and English.",
          "start": 48.468,
          "slot": 3.373,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.373,
            "en": 3.792
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd03-01.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.373
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-02",
          "zh": "比如，一个孩子能听懂中文，却还不认识很多汉字。",
          "en": "One child may understand spoken Chinese but know only a few Chinese characters.",
          "start": 52.264,
          "slot": 5.115,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.115,
            "en": 4.672
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd03-02.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.115
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-03",
          "zh": "另一个孩子读中文比较顺，讲英文时却需要帮助。",
          "en": "Another may read Chinese more easily but need help speaking English.",
          "start": 57.725,
          "slot": 4.07,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.07,
            "en": 4.411
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd03-03.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.07
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-04",
          "zh": "这些情况和阅读障碍有不同的原因。",
          "en": "These difficulties have different causes from dyslexia.",
          "start": 62.295,
          "slot": 3.282,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.282,
            "en": 3.22
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd03-04.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.282
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-05",
          "zh": "它们提醒我们一个相似的问题：哪一步难？还能从哪里开始？",
          "en": "They invite a similar teaching question: which step is difficult, and where else can we begin?",
          "start": 66.038,
          "slot": 6.244,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.244,
            "en": 5.809
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd03-05.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 6.244
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd04",
      "start": 72.975,
      "end": 97.421,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd04-01",
          "zh": "我们来设想两个孩子。",
          "en": "Let's imagine two children.",
          "start": 73.513,
          "slot": 3.057,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.057,
            "en": 2.374
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd04-01.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.057
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-02",
          "zh": "Jacob 用中文讲故事比较顺，Mary 用英文讲比较顺。",
          "en": "Jacob tells stories more easily in Chinese. Mary tells them more easily in English.",
          "start": 76.916,
          "slot": 5.209,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.209,
            "en": 6.301
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd04-02.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.209
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-03",
          "zh": "学中文时，Jacob 可以帮 Mary；学英文时，Mary 可以帮 Jacob。",
          "en": "Jacob can help Mary with Chinese, and Mary can help Jacob with English.",
          "start": 82.471,
          "slot": 5.584,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.584,
            "en": 4.818
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd04-03.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.584
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-04",
          "zh": "这就是“互惠”：我有能帮你的地方，你也有能帮我的地方。",
          "en": "That is reciprocity: I have something that can help you, and you have something that can help me.",
          "start": 88.709,
          "slot": 5.48,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.48,
            "en": 6.712
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd04-04.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.48
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-05",
          "zh": "两个人都教，也都学。",
          "en": "Both children teach, and both learn.",
          "start": 94.612,
          "slot": 2.116,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 2.116,
            "en": 2.765
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd04-05.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.116
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd05",
      "start": 97.421,
      "end": 119.919,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd05-01",
          "zh": "可是，一开始话还说不通，怎么办？",
          "en": "What if they cannot yet explain everything to each other?",
          "start": 97.959,
          "slot": 3.566,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.566,
            "en": 3.154
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd05-01.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.566
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-02",
          "zh": "我们想到画画。",
          "en": "We thought of drawing.",
          "start": 102.179,
          "slot": 1.583,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 1.583,
            "en": 1.951
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd05-02.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 1.583
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-03",
          "zh": "两个人可以先画同一个故事，看同一张图。",
          "en": "They can draw the same story and look at the same picture.",
          "start": 104.108,
          "slot": 3.361,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.361,
            "en": 3.42
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd05-03.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.361
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-04",
          "zh": "图画让他们有一件可以一起看、一起说的事。",
          "en": "Now they have something to look at and talk about together.",
          "start": 107.815,
          "slot": 3.756,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.756,
            "en": 3.431
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd05-04.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.756
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-05",
          "zh": "这是他们共同的渠道。",
          "en": "Drawing is a channel they share.",
          "start": 111.994,
          "slot": 1.824,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 1.824,
            "en": 2.13
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/zh/rd05-05.wav",
                "lang": "zh",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 1.824
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-06",
          "zh": "看图之后，也要问问对方：你想表达的是这个意思吗？",
          "en": "They still need to ask each other: is this what you meant?",
          "start": 114.28,
          "slot": 4.947,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.947,
            "en": 3.472
          },
          "tracks": {
            "zh": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-06",
